      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are alright, but a bit soft for a roast. i need them to be more biting. like, lean into the actual stereotypes people associate with them—the loud yelling, the different attitudes towards work or money, even just the way they act in public. make them a bit more edgy/edgy humor style so the audience actually gets a laugh.",
